Renovate PR
    │
    ▼
GitHub Actions CI
    │
    ├── Pass ──► Merge / continue normal review
    │
    │
    ▼
Build/Test Fails
    │
    ▼
GitHub Issue
(dynamic title + build log + PR link)
    │
    ▼
CoreStory Agentic Bug Resolution
    │
    ▼
Dependency impact analysis
    │
    ▼
Minimal remediation
    │
    ▼
Local focused build/test
    │
    ├── Fail ──► Return to impact analysis / adjust fix
    │
    ▼
Local broader validation
    │
    ├── Fail ──► Return to impact analysis / adjust fix
    │
    ▼
Commit fix to PR
    │
    ▼
GitHub Actions CI
    │
    ├── Fail ──► Update existing issue with latest failure
    │
    │              │
    │
    │              ▼
    │        CoreStory continues investigation
    │
    ▼
Pass
    │
    ▼
Merge / document remediation
